#                  D vector                   98,304      0.01%     FP32            FP32          BF16★        FP32             FP32             FP32
#                  Λ (Lambda)                 98,304      0.01%     FP32            FP32          BF16★        FP32             FP32             FP32
#                  log_step                   49,152     <0.01%     FP32            FP32          BF16★        FP32             FP32             FP32
#                  associative_scan              —          —       —               FP32          BF16★        FP32             —                —
#                  GLU Dense             302,088,192     29.38%     FP32            BF16          BF16         BF16             FP32‡            FP32
#                  LayerNorm                 196,608      0.02%     FP32            BF16          BF16         BF16             FP32‡            FP32
#                  Encoder Dense          18,877,440      1.84%     FP32            BF16          BF16         BF16             FP32‡            FP32
#  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Msg Encoder     Embedding + Dense      63,144,960      6.14%     FP32            BF16          BF16         BF16             FP32‡            FP32
#  (6.14%)         S5 layer (internal)         (incl.)      —       FP32            BF16†         BF16         FP32             FP32             FP32
#  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Book Encoder    Pre-layers              3,350,061      0.33%     FP32            BF16          BF16         BF16             FP32‡            FP32
#  (3.24%)         Projection              1,548,288      0.15%     FP32            BF16          BF16         BF16             FP32‡            FP32
#                  Post-layers            28,328,448      2.76%     FP32            BF16          BF16         BF16             FP32‡            FP32
#  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Decoder         Dense                   6,490,176      0.63%     FP32            FP32          FP32         FP32             FP32             FP32
#  (0.63%)
#  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Loss            cross_entropy + z-loss        —          —       —               FP32§         FP32         FP32             —                —
#  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  TOTAL                               1,028,249,709    100.00%
#  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

#  ★ SSM: BF16 → FP32 (compute) → BF16. SSM receives BF16 input, casts to FP32 for internal computation, then casts output back to BF16.
#  † B/C matmul: FP32 params cast to BF16 for matvec, result cast back to FP32 for associative_scan.
#  ‡ All gradients cast to FP32 after backward pass (MaxText pattern) for numerical stability.
#  § Loss computed in FP32 with z-loss (weight=0.0001) to prevent logits drift in BF16 training.